TITLE Pure water at pH 7.0 equilibrated with CO2(g) at log PCO2 = -3.4

SOLUTION 1
    temp      25
    pH        7.0
    pe        4
    redox     pe
    units     mol/kgw
    density   1
    water     1 # kg

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    CO2(g)    -3.4    10.0

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file     co2_eq.sel
    -reset    false
    -equilibrium_phases  CO2(g)

END
